# Mutations for mutate.py. Each one swaps a piece of BoundedQueue.tla for a
# plausible bug and names the one property that must fail on it. The text
# after `- ` must occur exactly once in the spec; `+ ` lines replace it. An
# optional `only <label-substring>` line limits the matrix runs. Every property
# the matrix checks needs a mutation.

mutation claim one item past the window
detects InWindow
- /\ next < consumed + Window
+ /\ next <= consumed + Window

mutation claim after the last item
detects TypeOK
- Claim == /\ next < Items
+ Claim == /\ next <= Items

mutation consume never runs
detects AllConsumed
only items=3
- Consume == /\ consumed < next
+ Consume == /\ consumed < 0

mutation the window never fills
detects reach:WindowFull
- /\ next < consumed + Window
+ /\ next < consumed + Window - 1
